      "refersTo": "answer-panel",
      "description": "Signature: black panel with a slanted question tab, lime face, Anton total, and a per-day film-strip reel.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-answer\"><div class=\"ds-ah\"><span class=\"ds-atab\">เดือนนี้ใช้ได้อีก</span><span class=\"ds-afill\"></span></div><div class=\"ds-ab\"><p class=\"ds-anum\"><span class=\"ds-cur\">฿</span>6,530</p><p class=\"ds-aline\">อีก 11 วัน · ใช้ได้วันละ <b>฿593</b></p></div><div class=\"ds-reel\"><i class=\"hi\"></i><i class=\"ok\"></i><i class=\"ok\"></i><i class=\"none\"></i><i class=\"hi\"></i><i class=\"ok\"></i><i class=\"ok\"></i><i class=\"none today\"></i><i class=\"future\"></i><i class=\"future\"></i><i class=\"future\"></i><i class=\"future\"></i></div></section>",
